<title>CHINA: HSBC says Hang Seng Bk H1 net up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>HSBC says Hang Seng Bk H1 net up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hang Seng Bank Ltd posted a 15 percent rise in interim profit to HK$4,982 million for the six months ended June 30, 1997, compared with HK$4,351 million in the same period a year ago, said its parent HSBC Holdings Plc in an earnings statement on Monday.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6370</p>
